  "description": "Modern, AOT-ready rewrite of FileHelpers 3.x for .NET 10. Reads and writes delimited (CSV, TSV, ...) and fixed-length files. Record descriptors are created at compile time by a bundled source generator, so there is no runtime reflection and the library is trimming- and Native AOT-compatible. Reading record structs causes no per-record allocations by the engine (string field values still allocate their text). FileHelpers 3.x-style API (record attributes, engines, error modes); the migration guide lists the differences.",
